  "text": "Use this hack to make up to double this NFL season with your futures bets. This is a method we like to call the double dip and this is how it works. Find futures bets that have value, take the amount of money you want to bet, and bet two identical tickets. This is a good example from earlier in March Madness where we identified lots of value on FAU at plus $20,000. We bet one unit, $100 for us, and we bought four identical tickets. Now if you've actually identified a good bet, the value of this ticket will increase throughout the season. The problem is you can't cash out without limiting your upside. What this method allows you to do is to sell tickets to lock up profit, but keep your upside intact by letting those ride. As you can see here, we were able to lock up $1,000 in profit while letting our two other tickets ride for up to a $10,000 profit. And that's how you can...",
